{"seq":4,"slug":"edge-deployment","title":"端侧部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/deployment-and-inference/edge-deployment","wordCount":742,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"端侧部署\">端侧部署</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>端侧部署的取舍围绕几个概念展开，后面各节是不同平台的具体方案：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>端侧 vs 云端 vs 混合</strong>：端侧数据不离设备、延迟低且稳定、可离线，但模型能力受限；云端能力最强但依赖网络与上传数据。</li>\n<li><strong>推理引擎</strong>：llama.cpp 以纯 C/C++ 实现、支持 CPU/Metal/CUDA 多后端；Apple MLX 针对 Apple Silicon 优化。</li>\n<li><strong>GGUF 与混合精度量化</strong>：不同层可用不同位宽，Q4_K_M 是消费级硬件的默认甜点配置。</li>\n<li><strong>统一内存</strong>：Apple Silicon 的 CPU/GPU 共享内存使模型不受显存上限约束，可利用全部系统内存。</li>\n<li><strong>平台约束</strong>：iOS 走 CoreML、Android 走 llama.cpp、Web 走 WebLLM/ONNX，模型与引擎需按平台匹配。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括其定位：<strong>端侧部署用「模型能力」换「隐私、离线与稳定延迟」</strong>，因此配置选择的实质是在模型大小、量化程度、上下文长度与功耗之间找到设备的平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要端侧部署\">为什么要端侧部署</h2><p>端侧部署（On-device / Edge Deployment）指将 LLM 运行在本地设备上（PC、手机、嵌入式设备），而非依赖云端服务。它在隐私保护、离线可用性和延迟控制方面具有不可替代的优势。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 云端推理&#10;        C1[&quot;用户设备&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;网络请求&quot;| C2[&quot;云端 GPU&quot;]&#10;        C2 --&gt;|&quot;网络响应&quot;| C1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 端侧推理&#10;        E1[&quot;用户设备&quot;] --&gt; E2[&quot;本地模型&quot;]&#10;        E2 --&gt; E3[&quot;本地输出&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 云端推理\n        C1[\"用户设备\"] --&gt;|\"网络请求\"| C2[\"云端 GPU\"]\n        C2 --&gt;|\"网络响应\"| C1\n    end\n    subgraph 端侧推理\n        E1[\"用户设备\"] --&gt; E2[\"本地模型\"]\n        E2 --&gt; E3[\"本地输出\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部署方式</th>\n<th>隐私</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>离线</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>模型能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>云端</td>\n<td>数据需上传</td>\n<td>受网络影响</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>按量计费</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端侧</td>\n<td>数据不离设备</td>\n<td>低且稳定</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>一次性硬件</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>按需选择</td>\n<td>弹性</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>弹性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"llama-cpp\">llama.cpp</h2><p>llama.cpp 是最流行的端侧 LLM 推理引擎，纯 C/C++ 实现，无需 GPU 即可运行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 安装和使用 llama.cpp&#10;# git clone https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp&#10;# cd llama.cpp &amp;&amp; make -j&#10;# ./llama-cli -m model.gguf -p &quot;Hello&quot; -n 128&#10;&#10;llama_cpp_features = {&#10;    &quot;纯 CPU 推理&quot;: &quot;无需 GPU，支持 AVX2/AVX512&quot;,&#10;    &quot;Metal 加速&quot;: &quot;Apple Silicon GPU 加速&quot;,&#10;    &quot;CUDA 支持&quot;: &quot;NVIDIA GPU 可选加速&quot;,&#10;    &quot;Vulkan 支持&quot;: &quot;跨平台 GPU 加速&quot;,&#10;    &quot;GGUF 格式&quot;: &quot;灵活的混合精度量化&quot;,&#10;    &quot;KV 缓存量化&quot;: &quot;进一步减少内存&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;print(&quot;llama.cpp 核心特性:&quot;)&#10;for feature, desc in llama_cpp_features.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;  {feature}: {desc}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装和使用 llama.cpp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># git clone https://github.com/ggerganov/llama.cpp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># cd llama.cpp &#x26;&#x26; make -j</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ./llama-cli -m model.gguf -p \"Hello\" -n 128</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">llama_cpp_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"纯 CPU 推理\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"无需 GPU，支持 AVX2/AVX512\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Metal 加速\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Apple Silicon GPU 加速\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"CUDA 支持\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"NVIDIA GPU 可选加速\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Vulkan 支持\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"跨平台 GPU 加速\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"GGUF 格式\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"灵活的混合精度量化\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"KV 缓存量化\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"进一步减少内存\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"llama.cpp 核心特性:\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feature, desc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llama_cpp_features.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"  </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">feature</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">desc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 使用 llama-cpp-python 绑定&#10;# pip install llama-cpp-python&#10;&#10;# from llama_cpp import Llama&#10;# llm = Llama(&#10;#     model_path=&quot;./models/llama-3.1-8b-q4_k_m.gguf&quot;,&#10;#     n_ctx=4096,&#10;#     n_gpu_layers=35,  # 部分层卸载到 GPU&#10;#     n_threads=8,&#10;# )&#10;#&#10;# output = llm.create_chat_completion(&#10;#     messages=[{&quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;你好&quot;}],&#10;#     max_tokens=256,&#10;#     temperature=0.7,&#10;# )&#10;&#10;print(&quot;llama-cpp-python 提供 OpenAI 兼容的 Python API&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 llama-cpp-python 绑定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pip install llama-cpp-python</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># from llama_cpp import Llama</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># llm = Llama(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     model_path=\"./models/llama-3.1-8b-q4_k_m.gguf\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     n_ctx=4096,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     n_gpu_layers=35,  # 部分层卸载到 GPU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     n_threads=8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># output = llm.create_chat_completion(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     messages=[{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"你好\"}],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     max_tokens=256,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#     temperature=0.7,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"llama-cpp-python 提供 OpenAI 兼容的 Python API\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"apple-mlx\">Apple MLX</h2><p>MLX 是 Apple 专为 Apple Silicon 优化的机器学习框架，在 M 系列芯片上提供高效的 LLM 推理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# pip install mlx-lm&#10;&#10;# from mlx_lm import load, generate&#10;# model, tokenizer = load(&quot;mlx-community/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct-4bit&quot;)&#10;# response = generate(model, tokenizer, prompt=&quot;Hello&quot;, max_tokens=100)&#10;&#10;mlx_advantages = {&#10;    &quot;统一内存&quot;: &quot;CPU 和 GPU 共享内存，无需拷贝&quot;,&#10;    &quot;懒计算&quot;: &quot;只在需要时计算，节省资源&quot;,&#10;    &quot;原生 Metal&quot;: &quot;深度优化 Apple GPU 调度&quot;,&#10;    &quot;量化支持&quot;: &quot;4-bit, 8-bit 量化模型&quot;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;apple_silicon_perf = {&#10;    &quot;M1 (8GB)&quot;: {&quot;max_model&quot;: &quot;3B Q4&quot;, &quot;speed&quot;: &quot;~15 tok/s&quot;},&#10;    &quot;M1 Pro (16GB)&quot;: {&quot;max_model&quot;: &quot;7B Q4&quot;, &quot;speed&quot;: &quot;~20 tok/s&quot;},&#10;    &quot;M2 Max (32GB)&quot;: {&quot;max_model&quot;: &quot;13B Q4&quot;, &quot;speed&quot;: &quot;~25 tok/s&quot;},&#10;    &quot;M3 Max (48GB)&quot;: {&quot;max_model&quot;: &quot;34B Q4&quot;, &quot;speed&quot;: &quot;~20 tok/s&quot;},&#10;    &quot;M2 Ultra (192GB)&quot;: {&quot;max_model&quot;: &quot;70B Q4&quot;, &quot;speed&quot;: &quot;~15 tok/s&quot;},&#10;}&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;{&#39;芯片&#39;:&lt;20} {&#39;最大模型&#39;:&gt;12} {&#39;速度&#39;:&gt;15}&quot;)&#10;print(&quot;-&quot; * 50)&#10;for chip, info in apple_silicon_perf.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;{chip:&lt;20} {info[&#39;max_model&#39;]:&gt;12} {info[&#39;speed&#39;]:&gt;15}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pip install mlx-lm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># from mlx_lm import load, generate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># model, tokenizer = load(\"mlx-community/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct-4bit\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># response = generate(model, tokenizer, prompt=\"Hello\", max_tokens=100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mlx_advantages </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"统一内存\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CPU 和 GPU 共享内存，无需拷贝\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"懒计算\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"只在需要时计算，节省资源\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"原生 Metal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"深度优化 Apple GPU 调度\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"量化支持\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"4-bit, 8-bit 量化模型\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">apple_silicon_perf </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"M1 (8GB)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3B Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"speed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~15 tok/s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"M1 Pro (16GB)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"7B Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"speed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"~20 tok/s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"M2 Max (32GB)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"13B Q4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F